<title>USA: IPO FILING - Metals USA Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Metals USA Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    Metals USA Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			MUI.N</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    20,782,023</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  885,000 shrs Business: based in Houston, Texas, Metals is a national value-added metals processor/service center, to manufacture higher-value components from processed metals and to pursue aggressively the consolidation of the highly-fragmented metals processing industry.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To pay the cash portion of the purchase price for the founding companies, to repay expenses incurred in connection with the organization of Metals and the offering and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
